('At a chemical synapse, which event directly triggers exocytosis of neurotransmitter vesicles?', 'Influx of Ca2+ through voltage-gated Ca2+ channels', 'Influx of Na+ through voltage-gated Na+ channels', 'Binding of acetylcholine to postsynaptic receptors', 'Opening of presynaptic K+ channels', 'Influx of Ca2+ through voltage-gated Ca2+ channels', 'Depolarisation of the presynaptic terminal opens voltage-gated Ca2+ channels; Ca2+ entry triggers SNARE-mediated vesicle fusion.', 1150, 'Physiology'),
