('During isovolumetric contraction in the cardiac cycle, both the mitral and aortic valves are:', 'Both closed', 'Both open', 'Mitral open, aortic closed', 'Mitral closed, aortic open', 'Both closed', 'Isovolumetric contraction begins when the mitral valve closes (rising pressure) and ends when pressure exceeds aortic diastolic pressure to open the aortic valve.', 1400, 'Physiology'),
